Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:37:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Enable KaTeX math on the web markdown renderer

v0.13.2 replaced react-native-markdown-display with
react-native-enriched-markdown, which already renders $ / $$ via KaTeX
when latexMath is on and katex is installed. Turn that path on for the
web client, normalize \( \) and \[ \] to dollar delimiters (skipping
code and image alts), theme math from the UI colors, and keep the UI
font override off KaTeX / MathML faces.
